{
  "_readme": "Week-6 studio puzzle bank for the three-arm Logic-LM experiment. 20 small Zebra/Einstein-style logic puzzles, each with the NL statement, the CSP encoding in the exact schema build_csp/parse_json expect (alldiff / neq / eq only), and the UNIQUE gold solution. 5 are marked worked_example:true (fully-worked starters; the first three match logic_lm.EXAMPLE_PUZZLES). Every puzzle is verified unique + matching by _verify_puzzles.py. Do not hand-edit a gold without re-running the verifier.",
  "puzzles": [
    {
      "id": "p01",
      "worked_example": true,
      "puzzle": "Three friends -- Ana, Bob, Cara -- each pick a different colour from red, green, blue. Ana is not red. Bob is blue.",
      "spec": {
        "variables": {"Ana": ["red", "green", "blue"], "Bob": ["red", "green", "blue"], "Cara": ["red", "green", "blue"]},
        "constraints": [
          {"type": "alldiff", "vars": ["Ana", "Bob", "Cara"]},
          {"type": "eq", "a": "Bob", "b": "blue"},
          {"type": "neq", "a": "Ana", "b": "red"}
        ]
      },
      "gold": {"Ana": "green", "Bob": "blue", "Cara": "red"}
    },
    {
      "id": "p02",
      "worked_example": true,
      "puzzle": "Two houses, numbered 1 and 2, one owned by Xu and one by Yara. Xu does not live in house 1.",
      "spec": {
        "variables": {"Xu": [1, 2], "Yara": [1, 2]},
        "constraints": [
          {"type": "alldiff", "vars": ["Xu", "Yara"]},
          {"type": "neq", "a": "Xu", "b": 1}
        ]
      },
      "gold": {"Xu": 2, "Yara": 1}
    },
    {
      "id": "p03",
      "worked_example": true,
      "puzzle": "Three tasks A, B, C run in slots 1, 2, 3 (all different). A runs in slot 1. C does not run in slot 2.",
